n this leaderboard?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Models are ranked using an Elo rating system derived from blind comparisons judged by our validated private evaluators. Voters compare two videos generated from the same text prompt without knowing which model created each video. Higher Elo scores indicate a model is preferred more often."}}]}37:["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$38"}}]
